Trademark notice

Linear is a trademark of Linear Orbit, Inc. This project is an independent,
unofficial integration. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored
by Linear Orbit, Inc.

The MIT licence above covers this project's source code. It does not grant any
right to use the Linear name or marks. This is also why the plugin ships its
own icon — a rounded card with a status line — rather than Linear's own angled
mark: redistributing a trademarked logo under MIT is a licensing problem the
artwork does not need to have, and bb renders a plugin's icon as a CSS mask
driven by `currentColor` anyway, so a logo would arrive as a silhouette of
itself.
